<report>
<title>Kruskal-Wallis: all pairwise comparisons (Dwass-Steel-Critchlow-Fligner)</title>
<p>Critical q (range) = @{q:roundu}</p>

<block name="dwass">
<table>
<tr><td>@t1 vs. @t2</td><td><ci>@diff</ci></td></tr>
<tr><td>(|@{wx:roundu}| > @{qval:roundu})</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>
<br />

<p>Kruskal-Wallis: all pairwise comparisons (Conover-Iman)<br />
Critical t (@{df:round0} df) = @{t:roundu}</p>

<block name="conover">
<table>
<tr><td>@t1 and @t2</td><td><ci>@diff</ci></td></tr>
<tr><td>(@{stata:roundu} > @{statb:roundu})</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>
</report>
